Stealth:
If an allied character or Companion can be selected as the main attack target, this unit cannot be selected as the main target for attacks or healing.
If no allied character can be selected as the main attack target, this unit can become the main attack target again. If multiple units are in Stealth, keep the effect on one based on the following order:
1. Character over summon;
2. Longer remaining duration over shorter;
3. Later trigger over earlier.
